# J3r: the TP2 G1 numbers on the same script - the pair at two links, general-2link (4 seats x 65,536)
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the TP4 bring-up (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it):
# copy it over .github/c2-serving-job.env, commit, and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig,
# a card or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time.
# Duration (estimate, wall clock; the workflow's step limits in parentheses): engine build 10-20 min (cached); bench 15-30 min: about 30-60 min; plus Jr before it.
# Push Jr (the four-card reset) first and this straight after it: no reset action here (see J2r).
# The pair's profile stops at 65,536 tokens, so its shapes stop at 60,000-token prompts and 4 streams; the 131k and 8-stream shapes have no TP2 G1 comparator (they are what TP4 adds).
C2_ACTIONS=smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-1
C2_PROFILE=general-2link
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,bench
C2_BENCH_SHAPES=1x4096,1x32768,1x60000,4x4096,4x32768,4x60000
